  "notes": "Verified modern scholarly chapter Work and the direct critical control for the Laws of Lipit-Ištar at the chapter's 573-602 editorial coordinate. It remains distinct from the ancient Work, physical witnesses, current Q000613/P464355 composite, encyclopedia entry, corrigenda, and every translation. Bibliographic sources conflict: CDLI reports 2014 and 455-612; JSTOR and the volume contents report 455-616; Wilcke's corrigenda say 2014, published 2015, and 455-616; the BAdW bibliography reports 2015 and 455-633. Those states are preserved rather than normalized into an uninspected Edition. The DOI identifies the chapter Work route but does not establish one exact Item, byte sequence, or immutable reading. No source payload, Expression, Edition, Manifestation, Item, passage, translation, semantic claim, graph relation, or canon state is created.",
